      "content": "REST API for the Invoiced accounts-receivable and billing automation platform. Manage customers, invoices, estimates, credit notes, payments, subscriptions, plans, items, and events/webhooks. All requests must use HTTPS. Responses are JSON and dates are returned as UNIX timestamps.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Invoiced Developers\n Email: developers@invoiced.com",
